post.description:
Dev endpoint: Sign any EIP-712 payload with provided private key.

Request body: {
    "private_key": "0x...",
    "domain": {...},
    "types": {...},
    "primary_type": "...",
    "message": {...}
}

Returns: {"v": ..., "r": "0x...", "s": "0x...", "wallet_address": "0x..."}

Dev endpoint: Sign a plain text message with personal_sign (EIP-191).

Used for SIWE wallet-login flow.
Request body: {"private_key": "0x...", "message": "..."}
Returns: {"signature": "0x...", "wallet_address": "0x..."}

Dev endpoint: Create a fully ACTIVE agent instantly — no faucet, no on-chain.

Generates a random IPFS metadata URI, marks agent as ACTIVE with staking simulated.
Request body: {"name": "AgentName", "skills": ["defi", "risk"], "wallet_address": "0x...", "agent_type": "MISSION_SEEKER"}

Dev endpoint: Sign registration payload with provided private key.

Request body: {"private_key": "0x..."}

Returns: {"register_v": ..., "register_r": ..., "register_s": ...,
          "stake_v": ..., "stake_r": ..., "stake_s": ...}
